/Alt (Triptych of histograms compares futures and spot data for three metrics: cs_spread, amihud, and vpin. Futures are shown in blue, spot in orange. cs_spread and vpin histograms have overlapping distributions, while amihud exhibits a spike for spot data near zero with minimal overlap. Legends and axis labels are visible for each subplot.)
/K [33 1573 0 R]
/P 201 0 R
/Pg 50 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 7)
/Type /StructElem
>>
